note: PLANET DEFENDERS 2 - an endless shoot-the-invaders game, made with HumanLang 0.6.1.
note: Home page, instructions, 4 difficulty levels, skills that drop and must be caught, music, best scores that are
note: remembered, and it works on phones (drag your finger to steer, touching also fires).
note: Keys: left/right move, space shoots (hold it), up/down choose in the menu, enter starts, pauses and goes back.

use math

